.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.docs
docs

# Framework build output. apps/docs/.next and apps/dashboard/.next are ~570MB
# between them and no image copies either — but `az acr build` uploads the
# whole context to the registry before the first COPY runs, so anything left
# here is paid for on every build.
**/.next
**/.turbo
.vercel

# Non-JS SDKs (~230MB). Not in pnpm-workspace.yaml, never copied by any
# Dockerfile, and irrelevant to the control plane image.
sdks

# Python/venv leftovers that would otherwise ride along from a local checkout.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
